## Intent & Decisions
User asked that the cs-review agents (fcis-reviewer, locality-reviewer, state-machine-reviewer) use Opus 5.5 on high effort, with a version bump, commit, and push. The agent used the full model ID claude-opus-5-5 rather than the alias opus, so a future Opus release does not silently change the reviewers. Minor bump 0.32.1 -> 0.33.0 because the change alters runtime behavior.

## Actions & Verification
Replaced "model: inherit" with "model: claude-opus-5-5" and added "effort: high" in each agent's frontmatter. Pushed master and notes.
Not verified: that a live /cs-review run starts the agents on Opus 5.5 at high effort. That needs a fresh session after the plugin update.

